** Probe: the GRIDPOLR block pyaermod's PolarGrid writer emitted before
** this branch (DIST init num delta, GDIR init num delta). Setup pass only.
** AERMOD said: RE E185 (no receptors, NUMREC=0) and RE W250 (duplicate
** DIST). GENPOL reads GDIR as num/init/delta, so 0.0 directions were
** generated; POLDST reads every DIST field as a ring, so 100/10/100 was
** three rings with a duplicate. The block pyaermod wrote had no receptors.
